OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's bid to reunite 'stolen'
OL,4,Aparcels with owners
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who found a number of Evri
OL,7,Fparcels ripped open and some of the
OL,8,Fcontents discarded in bushes has taken
OL,9,Fto social media to try and reunite
OL,10,Fitems with their owners.
OL,12,FKatie Brown said she found dozens of
OL,13,Fitems in The Avenues area of Hull on
OL,14,FThursday morning while she was on the
OL,15,Fschool run, including some of
OL,16,Fhigh-value.
OL,18,F"I don't like it when I lose my
OL,19,Fparcels, so I just thought it would be
OL,20,Fnice to try and get them back to
OL,21,Fpeople," she said.
